gbhz(){return"Don't be afraid to shoot. You'll miss some, but the shot you don't take never goes in."},
gbhA(){return"Use the wings, fill the box. Tonight, goals are our job."},
gbhB(){return"Patience. We shut the door; one chance is enough."},
